      "writtenOn": "2025-07-04T08:03:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I agree. I\u0027ll try to suppress the message, at least when comparing against the specified parents. I\u0027ll first need to reproduce it locally.\n\nAs for the branch - I do need it in 3.10, but I\u0027m fine maintaining it as a patch for the time being.\n\nThat said, I think a \"bad UI experience\" is still much better than an \"internal server error\" on push.",
      "parentUuid": "0d71f85b_bc6493a2",
      "revId": "9298f641a3e48a18899bafa6a6e2be93bdf8187c",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
